<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How rich the source, the Father as the fountain,</l><l>And all this wealth He wants man to enjoy!</l><l>O blessed fact, this vast exhaustless portion</l><l>Is now for us forever to employ!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>How wonderful, the Son is God’s expression</l><l>Come in the flesh to dwell with all mankind!</l><l>Redemption’s work, how perfectly effective,</l><l>That sinners we with God might oneness find.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Spirit is the Son’s transfiguration</l><l>Come into us as life the full supply.</l><l>Amazing fact, our spirit with the Spirit</l><l>Now mingles and in oneness joins thereby!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>How real it is that God is now the Spirit</l><l>For us to touch, experience day by day!</l><l>Astounding fact, with God we are one spirit,</l><l>And differ not in life in any way!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
